  "current_status_note": "Rechecked 2026-09-05. IBM yearbooks and mineral statistics retain commodity-specific reference years; the National Coal Inventory reports geological resources as on 1 April 2025, not mineable reserves or current production. CEA/NPP daily reports, MNRE monthly capacity tables and NCMM policy releases measure different things. Installed capacity, generation, resource, reserve, production, auction and operational-project status are not interchangeable."
